    <mxGraphModel dx="1981" dy="1922" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml Timer_State_Diagram\n&#39; UML Extended State Diagram for Timer System\n&#39; 4 States: Stopped, Setting, Running, Alarming\n\n&#39; Define states\nstate STOPPED {\n    STOPPED : entry / time = 0\n    STOPPED : Display: 00\n}\n\nstate SETTING {\n    SETTING : Button acts as increment\n    SETTING : Display: current time\n    SETTING : 3-second timeout active\n}\n\nstate RUNNING {\n    RUNNING : entry / beep(); start ticks\n    RUNNING : tick / time--\n    RUNNING : Button acts as cancel\n}\n\nstate ALARMING {\n    ALARMING : entry / start continuous beeping\n    ALARMING : Display: 00\n}\n\n&#39; Initial state\n[*] --&gt; STOPPED\n\n&#39; Transitions from STOPPED\nSTOPPED --&gt; SETTING : click [time &lt; 99] / time++\nSTOPPED --&gt; STOPPED : click [time == 99]\n\n&#39; Transitions from SETTING\nSETTING --&gt; SETTING : click [time &lt; 99] / time++; restart timeout\nSETTING --&gt; STOPPED : timeout(3s) [time == 0]\nSETTING --&gt; RUNNING : timeout(3s) [time &gt; 0] / beep(); start ticks\n\n&#39; Transitions from RUNNING\nRUNNING --&gt; RUNNING : tick [time &gt; 0] / time--\nRUNNING --&gt; ALARMING : tick [time == 0] / stop ticks\nRUNNING --&gt; STOPPED : click / time = 0; stop ticks\n\n&#39; Transitions from ALARMING\nALARMING --&gt; STOPPED : click / stop alarm; time = 0\n\nnote right of STOPPED\n    Initial state\n    Timer is inactive\n    Time remains at 0\nend note\n\nnote right of SETTING\n    User sets the time\n    Button increments up to 99\n    3s inactivity starts countdown\nend note\n\nnote right of RUNNING\n    Timer counting down\n    1-second ticks active\n    Button cancels countdown\nend note\n\nnote right of ALARMING\n    Continuous beeping\n    Button stops alarm\n    Returns to STOPPED\nend note\n\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="rTicNwp6T7DpHrGcynOU-37">
